OL,3,GNEWSACancer patient fights to scrap VAT
OL,4,Aon sunscreen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sussex woman is calling on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to scrap VAT on sunscreen
OL,8,Fafter being diagnosed with skin cancer
OL,9,Fat the age of 26.
OL,11,FJessica Zbinden-Webster from Ferring in
OL,12,FWest Sussex will deliver a petition of
OL,13,Falmost 100,000 signatures to Downing
OL,14,FStreet, calling on the government to
OL,15,Fscrap the 20% VAT charged on sunscreen
OL,16,Fproducts.
OL,18,FDiagnosed in 2018 Zbinden-Webster said
OL,19,Fshe wanted the government to axe the
OL,20,Ftax to make sunscreen "more accessible
OL,21,Fto more people".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
